      "releaseNotes": "This mid-Series update includes improvements to Forza Horizon 6 tuning including damping formulas, tune adjustments, and drift camber. Some of these changes will also improve FH5 and Motorsport tuning. Thank you to several Forza players for the feedback. Enjoy!",
      "version": "7.4.0",
